#Troubleshooting 3
-Detect issue with service and nginx pod

#Action
-'kubectl port-forward svc/nginx-service 8080:80' connect service port to pod port' Then curl to the url.
#Observation
-Failed to connect.
#Cause
-Pretty obvious service and nginx pod not connected.

#Action
-kubectl get pods nginx-pod. label it.'kubectl label pod nginx-pod app=nginx'. Then add it to service.'kubectl expose pod nginx-pod --name=nginx-service --port=80 --target-port=80'
'kubectl expose pod nginx-pod --name=nginx-service --port=80 --target-port=80'. 'kubectl get endpoints nnginx-service.
